A refused plus before an attribute run and a sibling is a letter

```
- a
+
{x}
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
+</li>
</ul>
<ul x="">
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
- +
{x}
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>+</li>
</ul>
<ul x="">
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
: a
+
{x}
: b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>a
+</dd>
</dl>
<p x="">: b</p>
```

